  "hypothesis": "Enter a long position in SPY at the open of the next trading day when the CBOE Volatility Index (^VIX) closes up ≥ 2% versus the prior close and the US 10‑year Treasury yield (^TNX) closes down ≥ 3 basis points versus the prior close; exit when SPY closes ≥ 0.8% above the entry‑day’s close or after two trading days, whichever occurs first.",
